{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +  text: 'Validation must come from new evidence that discriminates: it requires evidence whose\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +    likelihood differs across relevant candidate worlds, and fresh evidence changes reflective warrant\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +    only when its likelihood differs across the represented candidate worlds; otherwise further\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +    awareness expansion may be required before the agent can use the evidence for that comparison.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +    Because the agent may lack the awareness needed to formulate that comparison, this gives boards,\par}
