{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -so the extended strict-optimality hypothesis fixes each agent's committed\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -action at every cell, for every conjecture and every acting belief the\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -judged update can produce.  Play therefore never changes; the generated\par}
