{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0  \par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -Standard state-space models cannot represent nontrivial unawareness\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -(Dekel et al. 1998); generalized structures represent multiple\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -awareness levels and interactive beliefs\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -(Heifetz et al. 2006; Heifetz et al. 2013).  On belief\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -revision under expansion, reverse Bayesianism preserves relative odds as the\par}
