{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -state, the realized action profile, and its own consequence.  Episodes are\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -retained as tokens in a deliberative record $r_i$ and can be retrospectively\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -recoded after the agent acquires a new distinction; before acquisition,\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -neither belief nor action can condition on that distinction.  The\par}
