{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +### 4.4 What agents know and don't know \{#sec-epistemics\}\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The start-of-period perception of the current cell is what lets a cell-contingent policy be implemented; the state $s$ itself is never perceived.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Observability of the full action profile keeps the separation of causal from strategic error clean; a variant folding components of $a$ into $x_i$ changes bookkeeping only.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Retention without recodability-in-advance is the minimal separation between experiencing a particular and possessing a projectible concept for it: the agent can remember \u8220?customers like that one\u8221? without commanding a predicate that distinguishes them, and the technology of [section 7](#sec-inquiry) operates on exactly this material.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The idealization has a cost worth naming: recoding is treated as total and infallible once the predicate is held, whereas real reclassification of remembered particulars is partial and error-prone; [section 9](#sec-pivot) isolates where this matters.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The mechanism vocabulary $\\Theta$ is known to all agents from the outset; what an agent may lack is the *distinction* that separates states carrying different mechanisms.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Everything the paper formalizes as the representational product of insight is the production of such a distinction.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +For every cell $C$ of its current awareness partition, agent $i$ knows the induced cell probability $\\rho(C)$.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +When a refinement is acquired, the probabilities of the newly representable cells become available with that refinement.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +This does not give the agent access to the decomposition of a current cell into states or distinctions it does not yet represent.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Table 1 collects the epistemic specification in one place; the defining statements are referenced in its final column.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +**Table 1.** The epistemic ledger: what agent $i$ knows, observes, and never accesses.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Object | Agent $i$'s access | Reference |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +|---|---|---|\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| State $s$ | never perceived, at the time or in retrospect | [assumption 4.3](#ass-observation) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Own awareness cell $C_\{\\mathcal P_i\}(s)$ | perceived at the start of each period | [assumption 4.3](#ass-observation) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Realized action profile $a$ | observed at the end of each period, including rivals' actions | [assumption 4.3](#ass-observation) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Own consequence $x_i$ | observed at the end of each period | [assumption 4.3](#ass-observation) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Rivals' consequences $x_\{-i\}$ | never observed | [assumption 4.3](#ass-observation) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Mechanism vocabulary $\\Theta$ | known to all agents from the outset | [definition 4.1](#def-mechanisms) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Objective assignment $\\tau$ | never accessed; theories are cell-constant conjectures about it | [definition 4.1](#def-mechanisms) and [definition 4.2](#def-awareness) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Cell probabilities $\\rho(C)$ | known on current cells; the within-cell decomposition is not represented | equation (3) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Deliberative record $r_i$ | retained; the only record deliberation may use | [assumption 4.3](#ass-observation) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Analyst record $\\bar r_i$ (state labels) | never accessed by deliberation; consumed only by the technology | [assumption 4.3](#ass-observation) and [definition 7.2](#def-technology) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Recoding under a refinement | total and infallible once the refinement is acquired; unavailable before | [assumption 4.3](#ass-observation) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Test calibration $(\\eta,w,\\bar n)$, capacity $b_i$ | the agent's own; operated by the agent | [definition 6.1](#def-test) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +| Rivals' partitions, beliefs, policies | never accessed; rival play enters only through the empirical conjecture $q_i$ | [section 4.3](#sec-awareness-sub) |\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
