{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -assignments $m^0$, $m^1$, $m^n$.  The row law $\\tau$ is inexpressible: no\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -reweighting of $\\\{m^0,m^1,m^n\\\}$, on any evidence, produces it\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -([proposition 4.1](#prop-no-emergence)).  A firm that will later observe payoffs\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -irreconcilable with all three theories will find its posterior undefined, not\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -alarmed\u8212?the deterministic instance of [remark 4.2](#rem-self-sealing), in which\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -misspecification announces itself only because likelihoods hit zero exactly.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -With stochastic mechanisms, no announcement would occur at all.\par}
