{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -\\sum_\{t\\in r_i\}\\;\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +After discovery, the record contains two labeled observations: architecture $0$ objectively preferred at $s_\{00\}$, architecture $1$ at $s_\{11\}$.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Of the fifteen partitions of four states, exactly four are minimally restorative\u8212?each must separate $s_\{00\}$ from $s_\{11\}$: the row partition $\\\{\\\{s_\{00\},s_\{01\}\\\},\\\{s_\{10\},s_\{11\}\\\}\\\}$, the column partition $\\\{\\\{s_\{00\},s_\{10\}\\\},\\\{s_\{01\},s_\{11\}\\\}\\\}$, and the two partitions isolating one labeled state (figure 3).\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The record directs inquiry (eleven partitions are excluded) without determining it (four remain).\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +A natural complexity ordering counts the coordinates needed to describe a refinement: rows and columns are one-coordinate distinctions, the isolating partitions require two.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +A factor-seeking technology thus produces the row or the column refinement\u8212?and here direction runs out.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Define the *column world* $\\tau'(s_\{rc\})=\\theta^\{c\}$.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Through the discovery horizon and conditional on the diagonal-state event, it agrees with the row world on the full joint mechanism at both visited states, so the two worlds generate the discovery record and every truth-blind production-and-formulation output with the same probability by the same coupling argument, conditional on the diagonal-state event.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +No truth-blind rule can formulate correctly in both, a randomized rule succeeds in the worst case with probability at most one-half, and by [proposition 7.5](#prop-robust-sufficiency) a partition sufficient for both worlds must be the full partition into singletons: robustness costs every distinction the language can draw, which is exactly what a minimal technology economizes on.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The example also locates the failure mode of each residual candidate: whichever factor refinement arrives, its unique consistent theory extrapolates the wrong prediction to the two unlabeled states in one of the two worlds.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +## 8. The economics of inquiry \{#sec-economics\}\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Whether to prosecute a question must itself be a decision, and it must be priced at exactly the moment the action-guiding Bayesian calculation is disabled: at dissonance the acting belief is undefined ([definition 6.3](#def-dissonance)), and the candidate answers are not represented objects ([definition 7.2](#def-technology)).\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +This section builds the valuation from what the agent actually has\u8212?its deliberative record\u8212?and prices the rest through the success weight.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The resulting statistic is a genuine estimate, not a guarantee: the agent guesses at the worth of a distinction it cannot yet name, and the model keeps that epistemic honesty rather than smuggling in the analyst's restorative correspondence.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +### Assumption 8.1 (Costly, elective, dissonance-triggered production) \{#ass-elective\}\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The technology $\\phi_i$ operates only when agent $i$ experiences dissonance and elects inquiry, at cost $\\gamma_i>0$ in payoff units.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Let $k_i$ count agent $i$'s consecutive failed elections, reset to zero on any success.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Agent $i$ holds a *delabeled achievability weight* $\\lambda_i^\{(k)\}\\in(0,1]$, nonincreasing in $k$ with $\\lambda_i^\{(k)\}\\to0$: a subjective probability that an election produces a refinement *delivering the estimated value below*, defined on that event alone and not on the identities of possible outputs.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +On failure or abstention the standing policy is carried forward.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Awareness is cumulative: acquired distinctions are never lost, though theories formulated on them may later be rejected.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The weight is awareness of unawareness in delabeled form\u8212?the agent can believe that inquiry may yield a usable distinction, and grow less hopeful as attempts fail, without ever describing a candidate distinction\u8212?a construct with precedent in beliefs about unpredictable novelty (Schipper 2025; Karni and Vier\\o 2017).\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Its decay is the answerability meta-prior doing formal work: repeated failure is evidence that the question may be unanswerable (the record irreparable, the repertoire inadequate), and a rational inquirer eventually abandons it.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +That the weight prices *achievability*\u8212?not mere success\u8212?absorbs the gap between the agent's estimate and what an arriving refinement can actually deliver, a gap that is zero under the pointwise-transparency condition below and may be positive otherwise.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +### Definition 8.2 (Deliberative groupings and coherent classes) \{#def-pinned\}\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +A *deliberative grouping* $G$ of the record $r_i$ is a partition of its tokens.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +For a group $g\\in G$ and observed profile $a$, let\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +$$\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +n_g(a)=\\bigl|\\\{t\\in g:a(t)=a\\\}\\bigr|\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +$$\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +and, when $n_g(a)>0$, let $\\hat p_g(\\cdot\\mid a)$ be the empirical distribution of the consequences $x_i(t)$ among those tokens.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Define\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +$$\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\Theta_i(g)\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +=\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\left\\\{\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\theta\\in\\Theta:\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\TV\\!\\left(\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\hat p_g(\\cdot\\mid a),\\marg\{i\}\\theta(a)\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\right)\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\leq\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\eta+w\\!\\left(n_g(a)\\right)\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\ \\text\{for every \}a\\text\{ with \}n_g(a)\\geq\\bar n\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\right\\\}.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +$$\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The group $g$ is *coherent* if $\\Theta_i(g)\\neq\\emptysetset$, and the grouping $G$ is coherent if every one of its groups is coherent.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Write $\\mathcal G_i(r_i)$ for the finite family of coherent groupings of $r_i$.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Coherence, $\\Theta_i(g)$, and $\\mathcal G_i(r_i)$ depend only on the deliberative record\u8212?on observed actions and own consequences\u8212?together with the known mechanism vocabulary.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +They never use state labels or candidate refinements.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The family $\\mathcal G_i(r_i)$ may be empty under stochastic sampling: full support guarantees positive likelihood, not finite-sample passage of the consistency test.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +An empty family means only that the retained record supplies no coherent action-contingent decomposition the agent can price; it does not tell the agent whether an analyst-level restorative refinement exists.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +A coherent grouping is the agent's hypothesis about which remembered particulars share a mechanism.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +It is not a partition of $S$, and the agent cannot verify before insight that any refinement of its awareness would realize it.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +### Definition 8.3 (Deliberative leverage) \{#def-leverage\}\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Given a coherent grouping $G$, let $g(t)$ be the group of token $t$, let $C_i(t)$ denote token $t$'s cell under the current partition, and set $\\sigma_i(t):=\\sigma_i(C_i(t))$.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The *per-token robust gain* of proposing action $a_i$ for a group is\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +$$\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\Delta_i^G(t,a_i)\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +=\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0  \\min_\{a_\{-i\}\\in A_\{-i\}\}\\;\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -\\min_\{\\theta\\in\\Theta_i(t)\}\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\min_\{\\theta\\in\\Theta_i(g(t))\}\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0  \\Bigl(\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -\\mathbb E_\{x\\sim\\theta(\\psi(t),\\,a_\{-i\})\}\\!\\bigl[u_i(x_i)\\bigr]\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\\mathbb E_\{x\\sim\\theta(a_i,a_\{-i\})\}\\!\\bigl[\\pi_i(x_i)\\bigr]\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0  -\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -\\mathbb E_\{x\\sim\\theta(\\sigma_i(t),\\,a_\{-i\})\}\\!\\bigl[u_i(x_i)\\bigr]\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -\\Bigr), \\tag\{6\}\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -$$\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -\par}
