{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -to own actions, where $\\sigma_i(t)$ denotes the action the carried-forward\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -policy takes at $t$'s awareness cell.  Set $B_i(r_i)=0$ when there is no\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -dissonance or when $\\mathcal R(\\mathcal P_i,r_i)=\\emptysetset$.\par}
