{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +which requires one action for every token in a current awareness cell, although the coherent grouping is used to evaluate that action.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The grouping may span more than one current awareness cell, since any future awareness partition refines rather than erases current awareness.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +The *gross representational increment* under grouping $G$ is\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +\par}
