{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -$\\nu(\\tau')$, times the record's likelihood under $\\tau'$, times the\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -probability of the production event given the record; truth blindness makes\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -the last factor a function of the record alone, constant across\par}
