{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -consistent with the event.  The last claim applies the cancellation to\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -candidates with identical record likelihoods. \u8718?\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -\par}
