{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 -[corollary 8.3](#cor-self-audit), generally unknowable (to it) size.\par}
{\pard\f1\fs20\sa0 +Entertaining $\\tau'$ as a hypothesis requires expressing it, which is sufficiency ([definition 4.2](#def-awareness)); sufficiency for every candidate is refinement of the join. \u8718?\par}
